---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '@/components/SectionHeading.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="What VantriqSec collects through the contact form, why, where it's stored, and how to ask for it to be deleted."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="Privacy"
      title="What happens to the information you send us"
    />
    <p class="mt-6 text-text-secondary">
      This describes what actually happens when you use the contact form on
      this site — not a legal policy, just an accurate account of our own
      data practice.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">What we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary">
          When you submit the contact form, we collect the name and email
          address you provide, the message itself, and the IP address your
          request came from.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Why</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary">
          Your name, email, and message are used to read and respond to
          what you sent. The IP address is used only to limit automated
          spam and abuse of the form — it isn't used for anything else.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Where it's stored</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary">
          Submissions are stored in Turso, a hosted database provider. A
          copy of your name, email, and message is also sent to us as a
          notification email through Resend, an email delivery provider.
          The site itself runs on Cloudflare, which — like any web host —
          processes standard connection information (including IP
          addresses) to serve the page at all. These three providers are
          the only parties involved in running this site; none of them
          are given your information for any purpose beyond what's
          described here.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">How long it's kept</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary">
          Right now, indefinitely — there's no automatic deletion process
          in place yet. If you'd like your submission removed sooner, see
          "Requesting deletion" below.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Who can see it</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary">
          Only VantriqSec. Your information is never sold or shared with
          any third party beyond the infrastructure providers named above,
          who process it solely to make the site and the notification
          email work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Requesting deletion</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary">
          Email <a href="mailto:hello@vantriqsec.com" class="text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-400">hello@vantriqsec.com</a>
          and ask. There's no self-service deletion tool yet, so this is
          handled manually on request.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
